Output assets/slyph.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 700
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 90ms

Hide
Type "zig build" Enter
Sleep 5s
Type 'export PATH="$PWD/zig-out/bin:$PATH"' Enter
Type 'export COLORTERM=truecolor' Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "slyph"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "?"
Sleep 3s
Type "j"
Sleep 700ms
Type "j"
Sleep 1500ms
Type "H"
Sleep 2s

Type "f"
Sleep 800ms
Type "1"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "j"
Sleep 800ms
Type "j"
Sleep 800ms
Type "j"
Sleep 1500ms

Ctrl+L
Sleep 800ms
Type "ziglang.org/learn/samples/"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "j"
Sleep 900ms
Type "j"
Sleep 1800ms

Type "q"
Sleep 1200ms
Type "y"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
